  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Tranquilizers are neurologically active drugs used to treat stress and severe or mild mental disorders.<br />Equanil is an example of a tranquilizer that helps in controlling depression and hypertension.<br />This medication is used short term to treat symptoms of anxiety and nervousness. It acts on certain centres of the brain to help calm the nervous system.</p><p>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a2755766-f041-4667-b8a1-63839b4366c9-f0247494-7702-4af8-a6cd-674327490731-image.png\" style=\"width: 351px; height: 162px;\" /></p>",
